00:41:27,068 --> 00:41:56,313
this council and further discussions. I think I appreciate the understanding of the levels and also understanding where are the communities have failed or have stalled because of the added fees and the added regulations toward new growth. So I just wanted to share that with my councilors. I want to find that balance that we all work together to make sure we move something forward, but at the same time really understand

